### 회원가입 테스트
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jake@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "곽승욱",
  "nickname": "제이크",
  "region": "서울"
}

### 로그인 테스트
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jake@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 토큰 재발급 테스트
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/reissue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jake@example.com",
  "refreshToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJqYWtlQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4NDA4NDA0LCJleHAiOjE3ODg0MTAyMDQsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIn0.m0zAzzL-n0g-TqhZP7wWMivwVTDXwEgL-IPS6KG4RZOpNl9J8GSozSoIhl9-LnmwmtCRdIOJff61Kbijao3tvQ"
