### 게시글 작성 (API Gateway를 통해 요청)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJqYWtlQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4NDA4NDQzLCJleHAiOjE3ODg0MTAyNDMsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIn0.QqvMIqiI1Rc4xRebDQiKmD3D2q2U2zJr639AhzS9kiHOBam486n_fLb3xqOwJyzbcxWlW6PM7m0xZ84DADpn1A
X-User-Email: jake@example.com

{
  "title": "수리 요청합니다2",
  "content": "선풍기가 작동하지 않습니다. 확인 부탁드립니다."
}

### 게시글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/posts
Accept: application/json

### 특정 게시글 단건 조회 (ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts/1
Accept: application/json